<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="RUT" style="id">LUT- Zigua bible version</book>
  <para style="h">LUTU</para>
  <para style="toc2">Lutu</para>
  <para style="toc1">CHITABU CHA LUTU</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lut</para>
  <para style="mt2">CHITABU CHA LUTU</para>
  <para style="mt1">LUTU</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOZI</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Lutu chatamwila mbuli zikwehela zilaile, ziwalaila wantu wa kaya imwenga ya Waizulaeli mwe ichipindi cha walamuzi wa Izulaeli. Naomi, Mami ywa awantu we ikaya iyo, ajinkila chipindi cha uchiwa mkulu, hadya mgosiwe na wana wawo waidi wa chilume wabanikaga wakatenda we kwesi ya ujeni ya Moabu. Ivyo vize vijinke, Naomi niyo ahokela ujimbiko umo Lutu endaga yumwe mwa wakamwanaze na mkaya ywe isi ya Moabu hadya asagule kwa kunga mwenye atimilane naye na kumwambiza. Naomi ahalawa na Lutu watamba wauya kwe isi yakwe mwenye ya Izulaeli. Ivyo vize viheze Lutu na Naomi wose watenda wahokela ujimbiko hadya Boazi, yumwe ywa wantu wa hajihi we ikaya ya Naomi aliguhile hantu ha kuwatunduliya na kuzumila kumsola Lutu. Chipindi cha walamuzi chendaga chiha kwaviya Waizulaeli walizize nendile wakekala du hawakutmila sigilizi, mna Naomi na Lutu na Boazi ni mligano wedi wa Waizuaeli wekale na kutimila sigilizi za Chohile. Hahana yeyose amanyize chindedi uyo awandike ichitabu cha Lutu. Iviya talehe iwandikilwe ichitabu chino haikumanyika mna walozize wafanyanya kugamba chitabu chino chawandikagwa Waizulaeli weze walawe ko usamizo kugamba ko (utumwa) kulawana na Chiebulaniya chijesezwe mo kuwandika ichitabu chenye. Ni mbuli nkulu kugamba Seuta Daudi endaga mwezukulu ywa Lutu, mvyele endaga suyo Mwizulaeli. Vino ni kugamba mvyele yuno ana hantu mwa wantu wa kale wo ulukolo ywa Yesu. Mbuli ino yalavyanya ichindedi kugamba mevano na Chohile hayakulawana na kusagulwa chilukoloa, mna vyalawana na moyo wa mntu.</para>
  <para style="io">Yemndani. 1. Sula ya 1 yatambalisa mbuli za wantu we ikaya ya Naomi na uchiwa mkulu uwapatile, na ivyo Naomi na Lutu wawiye Izulaeli. 2. Mwe sula ya 2 chasoma ivyo Lutu abwilane na Boazi umo akachimaila mbuli zo uvuni mwe nkonde yakwe. Lutu nendile akasokoza msalaza usigale mwe nkonde ya Boazi wavuni weze waheze kuchisanya ulozo. 3. Sula ya 3 yatamwila ivyo Naomi amlagize Lutu kumunga Boazi amsole na kumtunduliya kwaviya endaga mntu ywakwe ywa mwe mbuli za nyinka. Ukalawa ahao Boazi azumila wigazi uwo. 4. Sula ya 4 yatambalisa ivyo Boazi aguile inkonde yendaga ya mta ukwaga mgosiwe dya Naomi, na vikaheza amsola Lutu.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="RUT 1" />
  <para style="s">Elimeleki no Lukolo lwakwe Wasamila Moabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 1:1" />Aho kale chipindi Walamuzi nawakalongoza mwe isi ya Izulaeli, mwe isi iyo kwalailaga gumbo. Elo, kwendaga na mntu yumwenga kulaila Beselehemu komzi wa Yuda aitaga kwikala kwe isi ya Moabu, uyo hamwenga na mkaziwe na wana wawo waidi wa chilume. <verse eid="RUT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 1:2" />Mntu uyo naketangwa Elimeleki, mkaziwe naketangwa Naomi, kugamba chinyemi changu. Wana wawo, yumwenga naketangwa Maholoni, umtuhu naketangwa Kilioni. Mntu uyo no lukolo lwakwe wendaga wa kabila dya Efulaimu uko Beselehemu mwe isi ya Yuda. Waitaga kwe isi ya Moabu, niyo wekala uko. <verse eid="RUT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 1:3" />Mna Elimeleki mgosiwe dya Naomi niyo abanika, asigala Naomi na wanawe waidi. <verse eid="RUT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 1:4" />Wabwanga awo niyo wasola wandele wa Chimoabu, wandele awo yumwenga naketangwa Olipa umntuhu naketangwa Luse. Ize yomboke mihilimo mlongo, <verse eid="RUT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 1:5" />Maholoni na Kilioni nawo niyo wabanika, Naomi niyo asigwa ichedu hena mgosi hegu wana.<verse eid="RUT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Naomi na Luse Wauya Beselehemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 1:6" />Akaheza, Naomi niyo eva kugamba Zumbe Chohile kawajimbika wantu wa kwe isi yakwe kwa kuwenka ulozo wa nkande. Ivyo, niyo emalanya kumlawa mwe isi ya Moabu kuya kwawo, hamwenga na wakamwanawe. <verse eid="RUT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 1:7" />Niyo ahalawa ahantu hadya nakekala, hamwenga na wakamwanawe, watoza isila wauya mwe isi ya Yuda, mna umo wachei mwe sila, <verse eid="RUT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 1:8" />niyo Naomi awagamba wadya wakamwanawe, “Uyani chila yumwenga kwa nine. Namlombeza Zumbe awajesezeni yedi saviya nyuwe muwajeseze yedi awo wagosi wenyu wabanike hamwenga na miye. <verse eid="RUT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 1:9" />Zumbe Chohile awenkeni chinyemi, mwezinyumba zenyu namsolwe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 1:9">Elo, Naomi niyo awalaga kwa kuwakubatila. Mna wowo niyo wakonga kwila kwa usungu, <verse eid="RUT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 1:10" />wamgamba, “Bule! Nachite hamwenga na weye kwa wantu wako.”<verse eid="RUT 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 1:11" />Naomi awagamba, “Bule, wanangu uyani kwenyu. Nimbwani mkunitimila? Mwafanyanya kugamba nadaha neleke wana vituhu nawatende wagosi wenyu? <verse eid="RUT 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 1:12" />Uyani kwenyu kaya wanangu, kwaviya miye sidalahalisa, sikudaha kusolwa naho. Hata hegu hagamba nina msuhi, na hata hegu hasolwa ichilo chino na kweleka wana, <verse eid="RUT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 1:13" />togolani! Mwadaha mjijimize kubula wakule watende wantu wajima? Mwadaha mwechinde msekutenda na wagosi watuhu? Bule, wanangu ivyo havikudahika, mbuli zinibwile zibuka udala, kujinka mwenyu, kwaviya Zumbe kanitunguluza.”<verse eid="RUT 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 1:14" />Aho, waila vituhu. Olipa niyo amkubatila nine vyala amlaga auya kokaya, mna Luse niyo amkagatila waitanye. <verse eid="RUT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 1:15" />Naomi amgamba Luse, “Kaula mnyawo kauya kwa wantu wakwe na kwe milungu ywakwe, ivyo, wenawe uya, mtimile mnyawo.”<verse eid="RUT 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 1:16" />Mna Luse amhitula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 1:16">“Usekunitigiza hwase,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 1:16">naho usekunichinda kukutimila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 1:16">Hohose nawite naho nami nanite,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 1:16">naho aho nawikale nanikale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 1:16">Wantu wako nawatende wantu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 1:16">naho Chohile ywako natende Chohile ywangu.<verse eid="RUT 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 1:17" />Aho nobanikile naho nami nanibanikile, nakuhambwa, Zumbe Chohile anikantile nkato ikulise hegu nnakwasa, mna file du niyo naichipagule weye na miye.”<verse eid="RUT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 1:18" />Naomi eze amwone ahikiliza kutimilana naye, niyo aleka kuhigana naye.<verse eid="RUT 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 1:19" />Wose waidi niyo wajendeleze ne ntambo kubula Beselehemu. Weze wabule uko, wantu wose wehelwa, wavyele wauzana, “Togolani, yuno suyo Naomi?”<verse eid="RUT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 1:20" />Naomi awagamba, “Mse kunitanga Naomi vituhu, nitangani Mala,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mala kugamba, usungu</char></note> kugamba usungu, kwaviya Chohile Mta udahi kautenda wikazi wangu wisungu vitendese. <verse eid="RUT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 1:21" />Miye hahalawa hano nasimemeza, mna Zumbe Chohile kanivuza sine chintu. Nimbwani mkunitanga Naomi, hegu Zumbe Chohile mta nguvu kanikantila na kanisulumiza?”<verse eid="RUT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 1:22" />Ivyo nivyo Naomi hamwenga na Luse mkaza mwanawe wawiye kulaila moabu kubula Beselehemu chipindi chokuvuna shaili chikakonga.<verse eid="RUT 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="RUT 2" />
  <para style="s">Luse adugana na Boazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 2:1" />Naomi endaga na mlukolo ywakwe akwitangwa Boazi. Endaga wa lukolo lwa Elimeleki mgosiwe. Uyo endaga mta kutunywa naho mgoli. <verse eid="RUT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 2:2" />Zuwa dimwenga, Luse mntu ywa Moabu amgambaga Naomi, “Nileka nite kwezinkonde hasokoze ulozo usigale. Simanya nani mpate mntu nanilekele nisokoze.” Naomi amgamba, “Hake hita mwanangu.”<verse eid="RUT 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 2:3" />Elo Luse niyo aita kwenkonde, awatimila wavuni kuno akalogota maiso wasize. Kumbeke kebwila emwe nkonde ya Boazi yudya ywo lukolo lwa Elimeleki.<verse eid="RUT 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 2:4" />Nyumani, Boazi niyo eza kulaila Beselehemu na kuwalamsa wandima wakwe wavuni, awagamba, “Zumbe Chohile awajimbikeni!” Wowo wamhitula,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 2:4">“Akujimbike wenawe.”<verse eid="RUT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 2:5" />Akaheza Boazi niyo amuza mchimaila ywa wandima wakwe wakuvuna, “Yuno mndele ni yuhi?”<verse eid="RUT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 2:6" />Yudya mchimaila ywa wandima wa kuvuna amhitula, agamba, “Ni yudya mndele alaile kwe isi ya Moabu ezile hamwenga na Naomi. <verse eid="RUT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 2:7" />Kanilombeza nimlekele awatimile mnyuma wakuvuna mwa amaiso. Ivyo niyo eza na kadamanya ndima kukongela mtondo, mna kakutweta hadodo kwedikumbi ivino haluse.”<verse eid="RUT 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 2:8" />Boazi niyo amgamba Luse, “Haluse tegeleza mndele. Use kwakusokoza amaiso hantu hatuhu mna mwe nkonde inodu. Timilana na wavuni wangu wechivyele. <verse eid="RUT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 2:9" />Wakaule kudya wakuvuna watimile. Siwafunda wano wabwanga wasekukuvigaviga. Naho unakalukwa, hita kwa mabiga ukanywe mazi ayo watekile awo wabwanga.”<verse eid="RUT 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 2:10" />Aho Luse niyo amwinamila Boazi kubula hasi kwa ntunyo, na kumgamba, “Sizumilwa vivihi kulongozi kwako? Ni mbwani wanifila mbazi miye mjeni du?”<verse eid="RUT 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 2:11" />Boazi niyo amhitula, amgamba, “Siyeva yose umdamanyize nyokwe vyala kukongela hadya mgosiwo abanikile. Simanya ivyo uwasize welesi wako, na isi yako welekwe, na kwiza kwikala kwa wantu hwimanyize kukongela chikale. <verse eid="RUT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 2:12" />Zumbe Chohile akujeleke kwa yose udamanye. Zumbe, Chohile ywa Izulaeli umgulukile akudime, akujeleke jeleko jejeje!”<verse eid="RUT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 2:13" />Luse niyo amhitula, “Sekulu, weye kunidamanyiza wedi ukulise. Hata hegu miye suyo yumwenga mwa wandima wako, selelwa vidala kwaviya kulonga na miye kwa ungi.”<verse eid="RUT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 2:14" />Chipindi cho kudya, Boazi kamgamba Luse, “So hano, udye mgate naho utweze mo msuzi.” Ivyo Luse niyo ekala hamwenga na wavuni wa Boazi niyo amwinka nkande ikazingwe, kadya niyo eguta na kusigaza. <verse eid="RUT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 2:15" />Umo Luse eze ajendeleze kusokoza amaiso, Boazi niyo awagamba wavuni wakwe, “Mlekeni avune hata hantu hana maiso ya shaili mse kumlemeza. <verse eid="RUT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 2:16" />Kujinka aho, msomweleni maiso ye shaili mwa machisa mlekeni alogote msekumlemeza.”<verse eid="RUT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 2:17" />Ivyo Luse niyo ajendeleza kuchisanya maiso ye shaili kubula chisingi, eze ayatowe niyo apata debe dya chilo mlongo umwenga dya shaili. <verse eid="RUT 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 2:18" />Niyo etwika isumwa yakwe aita komzi akumlagisa nine vyala icho asokoze. Naho, niyo alavya idya inkande ikazingwe asigaze eze egute na kumwinka. <verse eid="RUT 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 2:19" />Nine vyala niyo amuza, “Dyelo kusokoza kuhi? Kudamanya ndima kwenkonde ya yuhi? Zumbe amjimbike uyo akudamanyize yedi.” Aho Luse niyo amgambila Naomi kugamba kadamanya ndima kwa mntu akwitangwa Boazi.<verse eid="RUT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 2:20" />Naomi niyo agamba, “Zumbe Chohile amjimbike Boazi! Mazuwa yose Chohile achintiza ndagano zakwe kwa wantu wajima na wabanike.” Akaheza ajendeleza kulonga, “Uyo mntu ni mlukolo ywetu ywa hajihi naho ni yumwenga mwa wadya wakungwa wachitunduliye.”<verse eid="RUT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 2:21" />Naho Luse niyo amgamba, “Kanigamba niwatimile awavuni wakwe kubula wabinde uvuni wose.”<verse eid="RUT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 2:22" />Naomi niyo amgamba Luse, “Chindedi mwanangu, viwagila utimilane na wandima wa chivyele udamanye ndima mwe nkonde ya Boazi, kwaviya vyadahika nakufefeleswa wetile kwenkonde ya mntu mtuhu.” <verse eid="RUT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="RUT 2:23" />Elo Luse niyo atimilana na wavuni wavyele wakuvuna mwe nkonde ya Boazi, kachisanya amaiso kubula udumo wo kuchisanya shaili ne ingano. Mazuwa ayo yose nakekala kwa nine vyala.<verse eid="RUT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="RUT 3" />
  <para style="s">Luse asolwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 3:1" />Zuwa dimwenga, Naomi amgamba mkamwawe, “Togola! Mwanangu, sivyo vyedi hungile mgosi chani winkigwe yedi? <verse eid="RUT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 3:2" />Haluse yuno Boazi, uyo udamanye ndima na wavuni wakwe, uyo ni mlukolo ywetu! Elo, tegeleza chisingi cha dyelo natende aheta shaili molwazo. <verse eid="RUT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 3:3" />Ivyo weye haka mazi, wekulugute mavuta uvale suche zako vyedi, ukaheza wite kolwazo akuhetela. Mna use kwelagisa kwa yudya mntu, kubula kaheza kudya na kunywa. <verse eid="RUT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 3:4" />Naho, umanye hantu akunga agone, anasinka mbase mpalahole ugubule umgolole mweviga vyakwe ugone aho. Uyo nakugambile dyo kudamanya.”<verse eid="RUT 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 3:5" />Luse niyo amhitula, “Nanidamanye yose unigambile.”<verse eid="RUT 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 3:6" />Elo Luse niyo aita holwozo lo kuhetela ishaili, adamanya saviya nine vyala amsigile. <verse eid="RUT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 3:7" />Boazi eze abinde ukudya no ukunywa, niyo asangala. Niyo aita hajihi na chisa dya shaili agona. Luse kaita mpalahole niyo agubula umgolole mweviga vya Boazi agona aho. <verse eid="RUT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 3:8" />Chilo gati, Boazi eze asetuke, ahituka etuka kumbwila mvyele kagona mwe viga vyakwe. <verse eid="RUT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 3:9" />Auza, “Ni weye yuhi?” Luse ahitula,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 3:9">“Sekulu ni miye Luse, mndima ywako. Kwaviya weye wi mlukolo ywangu ywa hajihi, nigubika umgololole kwaviya wawagila unitunduliye miye mndima ywako.”<verse eid="RUT 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 3:10" />Boazi niyo agamba, “Zumbe Chohile akujimbike, kwaviya mbuli zose ukudamanya walagisa ntunyo itendese kujinka udamanye aho nkongo kwa nyokwe vyala, kwaviya hulondile wabwanga wachiwa hegu wagoli wakusole. <verse eid="RUT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 3:11" />Haluse Luse usa nkama, nahudamanyize dyo dyose ukunga ulombeze kwaviya chila mntu mo mzi uno kamanya uwedi wako. <verse eid="RUT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 3:12" />Ni chindedi kugamba, miye ni mlukolo ywako ywa hajihi, naho vyawagila hutunduliye, mna kuna mtakungwa akutunduliye mtuhu ehaguhi vitendese kujinka miye. <verse eid="RUT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 3:13" />Elo, ikala hano ichilo chose, luvi mtondo nachikaule hegu nazumile kukutunduliya hegu bule. Uneva anazumila navitende vyedi. Analemela, kwa zina dya Zumbe mta ujima miye nahutunduliye. Gona hano kubula mtondo.”<verse eid="RUT 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 3:14" />Ivyo Luse niyo agona aho heviga vya Boazi kubula mtondo. Mna niyo asunguza kwinuka chilo chilo chani asekuwonwa, kwaviya Boazi haungile mntu yoyose amanye kugamba nendile hana mvyele aho holozwo lo kuhetela. <verse eid="RUT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 3:15" />Boazi niyo amgamba, “Tandika idigunya dyako hasi.” Luse niyo adamnaya ivyo. Boazi niyo etila shaili ikuligana na chilo milongo midi, niyo amtwisa, Luse niyo auya komzi. <verse eid="RUT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 3:16" />Eze abule komzi, nine vyala niyo amuza, “Mwanangu vita vivihi?” Luse niyo amgambila yose yadya Boazi amdamanyize. <verse eid="RUT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 3:17" />Akaheza ajendeleza kulonga, “Kanigamba nise kuya kukaya kwa mame vyala mikono bule, ivyo kaninka ishaili ino ibwile chilo milongo midi.”<verse eid="RUT 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 3:18" />Uyo Naomi niyo agamba, “Haluse tongomala mwanangu, kubula uwone icho nachilaile. Dyelo, Boazi hatondowale kubula hadya nachintize yose alongile.”<verse eid="RUT 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="RUT 4" />
  <para style="s">Boazi amsola Luse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 4:1" />Boazi niyo aita kwechiwasa chokuduganila uko kolwivi lo mzi ekala hasi. Ukajika yudya mlukolo ywa Elimeleki uyo alongagwa ni Boazi niyo ajinka haguhi na aho. Boazi niyo amwitanga, amgamba, “Welewe so wikale hano hasi.” Yudya mntu niyo aita akwikala hasi. <verse eid="RUT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 4:2" />Akaheza, Boazi niyo etanga wadalahala mlongo umwenga wo mzi uwo, awalombeza nawo wekale aho hasi, niyo wekala. <verse eid="RUT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 4:3" />Boazi niyo amgamba yudya mlukolo ywakwe, “Haluse Naomi kauya kulaila kweisi ya Moabu, onga atage inkonde ya mlukolo ywetu mtokwaga Elimeleki. <verse eid="RUT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 4:4" />Elo, miye siwona ni vyedi umanye ulosi uwo. Haluse hegu wayunga inkonde iyo, ikombole kulongozi kwa wano wagosigwa wekale hano. Mna hegu hukuyunga ulonge vino haluse, kwaviya niweye ukuwagilwa kukonga kuikombola, luhenyo lwangu miye ni lwakaidi.” Yudya mlukolo agamba,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 4:4">“Miye naniikombole.”<verse eid="RUT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 4:5" />Boazi niyo agamba, “Ni vyedi, mna ukagula inkonde iyo kulaila kwa Naomi, iviya waungwa umsole Luse mvyele alaile kweisi ya Moabu, mwasigwa abanikilwe ni mgosiwe, mwana ywa mlukolo ywetu mtokwaga Elimeleki, chani nkonde isigaile mwa walukolo wa uyo mtokwaga.”<verse eid="RUT 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 4:6" />Yudya mlukolo ahitula, “Hegu nivyo miye simuli, nkonde iyo saniikombole, kwaviya unahasinya vyedi aho nanibalange ulisi wa wanangu. Navitende vyedi hegu nahwinke weye uwagilwa wangu wa kuikombola, mna miye umo simuli.” <verse eid="RUT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 4:7" />Elo, mwa mazuwa ayo yechikale kwendaga na mazwela mwa wantu wa Izulaeli, hegu mntu aunga akombole hegu kuhituila vintu, mntu nakalagisa kwa chilagiso cha kuvula idikwapa dyakwe na kumwinka mnyawe. Kwechilagiso icho, Waizulaeli nawalagisa kugamba mbuli ziliganywa.<verse eid="RUT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 4:8" />Elo, mntu uyo amgamba Boazi, “Nkonde iyo ikombole weye.” Niyo avula idikwapa dyakwe amwinka Boazi. <verse eid="RUT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 4:9" />Aho, Boazi niyo awagamba wadalahala na wantu watuhu wendaga aho, “Dyelo nyuwe mwi waukuzi wangu Muwona wenye kugamba sigula kulaila kwa Naomi vyose vyendaga vya Elimeleki na vya wanawe, Kilioni na Maholoni. <verse eid="RUT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 4:10" />Ukaleka ayo, simpata Luse kulaila kweisi ya Moabu, mwasigwa ywa mtokwaga Maholoni, chani atende mkazangu. Mevano yano nayahose ugoli wa mtokwaga na lukolo lwakwe visigaile kwa wantu wakwe mo mzi uno. Nyuwe mwi waukuzi wangu.”<verse eid="RUT 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 4:11" />Elo wadalahala wendaga henjili na wantu wose wendaga aho wahitula, “Heye, suwe chiwaukuzi. Zumbe Chohile amtende mkaziwo atende saviya Laheli na Leya wamwelekele Yakobo wana walozize. Naho ulozole mwa welekwa wa Efulata, utende na ntogozi uko Beselehemu. <verse eid="RUT 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 4:12" />Zumbe Chohile akwinke wana walozize kujinkila mo mvyele yuno, welekwa wako watende saviya Pelesi welekwa wa Tamali amweleke Yuda.”<verse eid="RUT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Boazi na welekwa wakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 4:13" />Elo Boazi niyo amsola Luse atenda mkaziwe. Zumbe Chohile niyo amjimbika Luse atenda msoka, niyo efungula mwana chilume. <verse eid="RUT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 4:14" />Wavyele wo mzi uwo niyo wamgamba Naomi, “Mtogole Zumbe Chohile hekwasize dyelo hwine mlukolo ywa kukutunduliya! Mwezukuluwo atende na ntunyo mwe isi ya Izulaeli. <verse eid="RUT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 4:15" />Mwana uyo nakuvuzize wikazi wedi nakutunduliye mo udalahala wako, kwaviya mkweo akukunga kadamanya vyedi kujinka wana chilume mfungate, kwaviya kakwelekela yuno mwezukulu.” <verse eid="RUT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 4:16" />Naomi niyo amguha yudya mwana na amlela.<verse eid="RUT 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 4:17" />Wavyele nawakekala haguhi na Naomi wamwinka zina dya Obedi. Wakagamba, “Kwa Naomi kwelekwa mwana!” Obedi niyo amweleka Yese, Yese amweleke Daudi.<verse eid="RUT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 4:18" />Wano nawo welekwa wa Pelesi, Pelesi amwelekaga Hesiloni. <verse eid="RUT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 4:19" />Hesiloni kamweleka Lamu, Lamu amweleka Aminadabu. <verse eid="RUT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 4:20" />Abinadabu kamweleka Nashoni, Nashoni amweleka Salimoni. <verse eid="RUT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 4:21" />Salimoni kamweleka Boazi, Boazi kamweleka Obedi. <verse eid="RUT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 4:22" />Obedi kamweleka Yese na Yese kamweleka Daudi.<verse eid="RUT 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 4" />
</usx>